---
// Finioo: a founder asks for two changes, the runway figure rolls up, and a change card offers Undo.
---
<div class="e-demo e-demo--finioo" data-demo="finioo">
  <p class="sr-only">Example: a founder asks Finioo to cut hosting costs and move a hire; the runway rises from 7.2 to 8.4 months and Finioo shows the change with an Undo button.</p>
  <div class="e-df" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="e-df__kpi">
      <span class="e-df__label">Runway</span>
      <span class="e-df__fig"><span data-seq data-order="2" data-roll="7.2" data-delay="600">8.4</span><small>mo</small></span>
      <span class="e-df__sub">Forecast · cash runs out in <b>June 2027</b></span>
    </div>
    <div class="e-df__chat">
      <div class="e-df__me" data-seq data-order="1" data-type data-delay="500">Cut hosting to $900 a month and move the hire to March.</div>
      <div class="e-df__card" data-seq data-order="3" data-delay="400">
        <span class="e-df__check"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4.5 12.5l4.8 4.8L19.5 7"/></svg></span>
        <span>Done. 2 changes. Runway <b>7.2 → 8.4 mo</b></span>
        <span class="e-df__undo">Undo</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
